@startuml
title T12-WF09 — AI CRM Conversation Summarizer (Sequence)
autonumber
actor "CRM UI / Ingestion Source" as UI
participant "NestJS Conversation Ingestion API" as API
participant "n8n WF09\nConversation Summarizer" as N8N
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Gemini API" as AI
participant "NestJS Notification Service" as NOTIFY

UI -> API: Submit transcript/reference with source context
API -> API: Authenticate requester; authorize source/customer scope; validate/rate-limit request
API -> DB: Create WorkflowRun with transcript/source reference
DB --> API: workflowRunId
API --> UI: 202 Accepted + workflowRunId
API -> N8N: POST protected internal webhook with scoped request/reference
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate source ID/type/length and correlation
N8N -> N8N: Fetch permitted transcript/reference and redact sensitive data before AI
N8N -> API: Save redacted transcript
API -> DB: Insert ConversationTranscript (redacted content only)
DB --> API: transcriptId
API --> N8N: transcriptId
N8N -> API: GET linked Lead/Customer and recent CRM context
API -> DB: Read profile and Interaction history
DB --> API: Available CRM context
API --> N8N: Context + source provenance
N8N -> N8N: Build prompt from redacted transcript/context
N8N -> AI: Request summary, intent, sentiment and proposed action items
AI --> N8N: Structured summary/actions
N8N -> N8N: Validate schema, evidence and uncertain statements
N8N -> API: Save ConversationSummary linked to transcriptId
API -> DB: Insert summary record
DB --> API: summaryId
API --> N8N: summaryId
N8N -> API: Save ConversationActionItem records (pending/review state)
API -> DB: Insert action item rows
DB --> API: Action item IDs
API --> N8N: Saved action items
N8N -> API: Request owner in-app notification
API -> NOTIFY: Notify owner with summary/action references
NOTIFY --> API: Notification status
API --> N8N: Notification status
N8N -> API: Record final workflow status/output
API -> DB: Update WorkflowRun/audit result
DB --> API: Saved status
API --> N8N: Accepted
deactivate N8N
UI -> API: GET summary/action results by workflowRunId
API -> DB: Read transcript/summary/action item records
DB --> API: Result references
API --> UI: Summary IDs, action IDs and run status
note over API,N8N
The browser/source does not call n8n directly. NestJS authenticates the request and
passes a scoped service-to-service request. Redaction must occur before the first AI call.
end note
@enduml
